    "detailed_description": "<strong>I can't help with anything, but please let me stay by your side.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><br>&quot;Yorisoi Delivery&quot; is an adventure game for lonely nights.<br>It's a game where you call for a &quot;just being there delivery&quot; and spend a late night together.<br>As people gradually gather, the house turns into a hangout spot, allowing you to enjoy a lively and fun night.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><br>1 hour<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Number of Endings</h2><br>1 (It is a linear story)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><br>This is an exploration adventure game where you &quot;move&quot; around the map and &quot;investigate&quot; areas of interest to progress the story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/28f38e4c3eff9657cc2ce82b2af209e0.poster.avif?t=1721980820\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/28f38e4c3eff9657cc2ce82b2af209e0.webm?t=1721980820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/28f38e4c3eff9657cc2ce82b2af209e0.mp4?t=1721980820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/5e1c4fe6f76b6576389be28c42f8dff2.poster.avif?t=1721980820\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/5e1c4fe6f76b6576389be28c42f8dff2.webm?t=1721980820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/5e1c4fe6f76b6576389be28c42f8dff2.mp4?t=1721980820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>You can't sleep. No one is beside you.<br>On such a night, you remember a strange ad you saw on social media.<br><br>&quot;Yorisoi Delivery.<br>When you feel lonely, please call us.<br>We can't help with anything,<br>but we will stay by your side until you no longer feel lonely.&quot;<br><br>Most people would forget such a thing.<br>It would disappear off the screen, lost in the scroll.<br><br>However, you remembered it.<br>Despite your skepticism, you install and launch &quot;Yorisoi Delivery&quot;.<br><br>At that moment, your room is enveloped in light, and a young girl stands before you.<br>&quot;Hello! It's Yorisoi Delivery!&quot;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><br><strong>You</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/2d0d59a13962c6bd7c08822d70b69453.avif?t=1721980820\" width=587 height=221 /></span><br>Yourself, the player.<br>One night, you install the suspicious app &quot;Yorisoi Delivery&quot; you saw advertised on social media.<br><br><strong>Yuko from Yorisoi Delivery</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/6dc5572dd220245a3683769aefe1c66a.avif?t=1721980820\" width=587 height=221 /></span><br>A cheerful and energetic member of Yorisoi Delivery.<br>Loves games, especially gets heated during competitive games.<br>&quot;Hello! It's Yorisoi Delivery!&quot;<br><br><strong>Kanmi from Yorisoi Delivery</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/cf2560c0765bf9271c5ac365807132e5.avif?t=1721980820\" width=587 height=221 /></span><br>A cool and kind member of Yorisoi Delivery.<br>Good at cooking and can make sweets with whatever ingredients are available.<br>&quot;Thanks for waiting. It's Yorisoi Delivery.&quot;<br><br><strong>Raika from Yorisoi Delivery</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/4a5a5d59b0b38124bff720f2f091b270.avif?t=1721980820\" width=587 height=221 /></span><br>An unstable member of Yorisoi Delivery.<br>Moody, sometimes lethargic, sometimes suddenly energetic.<br>&quot;Uhh... It's Yorisoi Delivery...&quot;<br><br><strong>Spera</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044810/extras/d0d0fb4478870e35915bee8899ee7e61.avif?t=1721980820\" width=587 height=221 /></span><br>A streamer with a niche but dedicated following.<br>It seems there was a time when Spera was involved with Yorisoi Delivery...?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Staff</h2><br><strong>col_ste_</strong> (@col_ste_)<br>Game design, art, programming<br><br><strong>Atree</strong> (@kazuki232)<br>Sound<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Posting and Streaming Guidelines</h2><br>Posting and streaming are allowed without permission.<br>You can post and stream the entire game.<br>Both individuals and corporate affiliates can post and stream.<br>Monetized posting and streaming are allowed.<br>Please include the game name in the title if possible.<br>We would appreciate it if you could include a link to the store page in the description (or similar feature).<br>We are not responsible for any damages caused by posting or streaming.<br>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Changing Screen Size</h2><br>You can change the screen size by performing the following operations on the options screen.<br>Keyboard: Press the 1 key<br>Gamepad: Press the view button or the menu button",
